@startuml
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/package-diagram-style.iuml
left to right direction
actor "Platform Operator" as Ops
actor "Security / Risk Owner" as Risk
actor "Delivery Team" as Dev
rectangle "Enterprise Operations Reference Architecture" {
 rectangle "Identity (Authentik / chosen IdP)" as IdP
 rectangle "Security Finding Intake
SAST/DAST/IAST/Trivy/SBOM" as Findings
 rectangle "ITAM / CMDB / ITSM
GLPI + iTop" as IT
 rectangle "GRC / Evidence
Eramba + evidence vault" as GRC
 rectangle "Delivery / Learning / CRM
Taiga + Moodle + SuiteCRM" as OpsApp
 rectangle "Isolated Finance Zone
GnuCash / Actual / Firefly / Ghostfolio" as Finance
}
Dev --> Findings : approved scans
Findings --> IT : bounded lookups
Findings --> GRC : normalized, verified facts
Findings --> OpsApp : remediation references
Ops --> IT
Risk --> GRC
IdP ..> IT : delegated authentication
IdP ..> GRC : approved federation
IdP ..> OpsApp : approved federation
Finance ..> GRC : approved aggregates only
note right of Finance
  No raw ledger/transactions into
  AppSec or general observability
end note
@enduml
